  "stem": "The vertex of the graph of \\(y = x^{2} - 10x + 31\\) in the \\(xy\\)-plane is \\((h, k)\\). What is the value of \\(k\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "6"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Complete the square: \\(x^{2} - 10x + 31 = (x^{2} - 10x + 25) - 25 + 31\\).",
    "So \\(y = (x - 5)^{2} + 6\\), and the vertex is \\((5, 6)\\).",
    "Therefore \\(k = 6\\)."
  ],
  "explanation": null,
  "traps": null,
  "verify": "x = symbols('x')\nf = x**2 - 10*x + 31\nhv = solve(diff(f, x), x)\nassert hv == [5]\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [f.subs(x, 5)] == [6]",
